{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines a WCAG 2.1 ratio with the given contrast ratio value"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"title":"init(ratio:)","externalID":"s:15MISOFoundations15MISOWCAG21RatioV5ratioACSd_tcfc","symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio\/init(ratio:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ratio","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"ratio","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The contrast ratio to use","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio\/init(ratio:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations","doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio"]]},"references":{"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"the following guidelines","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","title":"the following guidelines","url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"},"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations/MISOWCAG21Ratio":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"ic_layers.png":{"identifier":"ic_layers.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOFoundations\/ic_layers.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":null,"type":"image"},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr":{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","title":"Réf